     4733               vss-workfile vss-revision vss-description skip
     4734               "Ошибка при удалении документа возврата." skip
     4735               return-value skip
     4736               trim(error-status :get-message(1))
     4737               trim(error-status :get-message(2))
     4738               view-as alert-box error.
